# File Organization & Structure

## Directory Structure

### Operations Layout

Each resource operation is in its own file under `operations/{resource}/{operation}.ts`:

```
operations/
├── block/
│   ├── blockConstruct.ts
│   ├── blockDelete.ts
│   ├── blockFetch.ts
│   ├── blockInsert.ts
│   ├── blockMove.ts
│   ├── blockSchema.ts
│   ├── blockSearch.ts
│   ├── blockUpdate.ts
│   ├── blockUpload.ts
│   └── blockValidator.ts
└── collection/
    ├── collectionCreate.ts
    ├── collectionDelete.ts
    ├── collectionList.ts
    ├── collectionUpdate.ts
    └── collectionHelper.ts
```

### Properties Layout

Configuration properties under `properties/{resource}Properties.ts`:

```
properties/
├── blockConstructProperties.ts
├── blockFetchProperties.ts
├── blockMutationProperties.ts
├── blockSearchProperties.ts
├── blockUploadProperties.ts
└── collectionProperties.ts
```

### Root Helpers

- `Craft.node.ts` - Main node implementation
- `descriptions.ts` - Craft node property descriptions
- `helpers.ts` - Shared utility functions like `craftApiRequest`
- `mime.ts` - MIME type utilities

## File Size Limits

- Keep files **under 150 lines** when possible
- Split large files into smaller, focused modules
- Extract helper functions to separate files
